        //       ii. Push value to buffer.
        //    b. If buffer is empty (source exhausted), break loop.
        //    c. Yield buffer.
        //    d. Clear buffer.

        // Cleanup:
        // In the finally block, if iterator exists and is not done, call iterator.return().

